\newlabel{tab:ft-lora-configs}{{6.7}{75}{LoRA fine-tuning configurations. Learning rate and epochs (shown) were honored as requested; Together AI overrode other parameters: LoRA rank $16 \to 64$, alpha $32 \to 128$, dropout and weight decay removed. Mixtral uses standard LoRA on attention projections; Llama uses QLoRA with 4-bit quantization. Only Config~A was tested for Llama due to cost constraints}{table.caption.27}{}}
