\newlabel{tab:ft-per-category}{{6.9}{78}{Per-category accuracy and hallucination rate changes (fine-tuned minus baseline, in percentage points). Nonexistent and plausible-but-fake categories see dramatic improvements. Factual is the only category with an accuracy regression (Llama $-$3.1pp), driven by increased refusals}{table.caption.30}{}}
