\newlabel{tab:decontamination}{{6.10}{79}{Decontamination analysis: accuracy on full test set vs.\ clean subset (no entity overlap with training). Entity-independent categories (factual, ambiguous, impossible, edge factual) provide the fairest comparison---entity overlap should not affect performance on questions that do not test entity identity. Gaps on entity-independent categories are $+$1.0pp (Mixtral) and $-$0.1pp (Llama)}{table.caption.31}{}}
